const conditionFields={contract:[['remaining','合同剩余天数','number','天',['天','周','月']],['status','合同状态','text','',['']],['handled','跟进状态','text','',['']]],absence:[['status','考勤状态','text','',['']],['late','迟到次数','number','次',['次','天']],['absent','缺勤天数','number','天',['天','次']]],probation:[['remaining','试用期剩余天数','number','天',['天','周','月']],['status','评估状态','text','',['']]],training:[['need','是否需要带教','text','',['']],['done','是否完成带教','text','',['']],['days','派遣天数（首次派遣至今）','number','天',['天','周','月']]]};
function fieldUnitOptions(f){if(!f)return[''];if(f[2]==='text')return['','天','次','人','周','月'];if(f[4])return f[4];return f[3]?[f[3]]:[''];}function normalizeCondition(r){const f=conditionFields[draft.template].find(x=>x[0]===r.field)||conditionFields[draft.template][0];const opts=fieldUnitOptions(f);if(!Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(r,'unit')||!opts.includes(r.unit))r.unit=opts[0]||'';return r}function defaultCondition(){let f=conditionFields[draft.template][0];return{field:f[0],op:f[2]==='number'?'小于等于':'等于',value:f[2]==='number'?String(draft.days||30):'迟到',unit:fieldUnitOptions(f)[0]||''}}
function ensureRuleControls(){if(draft.scope.includes('总部职能中心'))draft.scope=[...new Set(draft.scope.filter(x=>x!=='总部职能中心').concat(['人力资源部','财务部']))];draft.schedule=draft.schedule||'daily';draft.weekdays=draft.weekdays||['周二'];draft.groups=draft.groups||[[defaultCondition()]];draft.recipients=draft.recipients.map(x=>x==='对应组长'?'组长':x==='对应仓长'?'仓长/职能主管':x);draft.fallback=false;draft.types=[];}
function conditionEditor(){return `<div class="condition-builder">${draft.groups.map((g,gi)=>`${gi?'<div class="group-or">或 · 满足任一条件组</div>':''}<div class="condition-group"><div class="condition-group-heading"><span>条件组 ${gi+1}</span><button class="delete-group" onclick="removeConditionGroup(${gi})">× 删除条件组</button></div><div class="group-expression">${g.length>1?'<div class="and-brace"><span>且</span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 1 C8 1 9 10 9 22 L9 38 C9 46 5 49 2 50 C5 51 9 54 9 62 L9 78 C9 90 8 99 18 99"/></svg></div>':''}<div class="group-condition-rows">${g.map((r,ri)=>`<div class="condition-row"><div class="condition-inputs"><select aria-label="条件字段" onchange="setCondition(${gi},${ri},'field',this.value)">${conditionFields[draft.template].map(f=>`<option value="${f[0]}" ${r.field===f[0]?'selected':''}>${f[1]}</option>`).join('')}</select><select aria-label="比较方式" onchange="setCondition(${gi},${ri},'op',this.value)">${(conditionFields[draft.template].find(f=>f[0]===r.field)?.[2]==='number'?['等于','大于','大于等于','小于','小于等于']:['等于','不等于']).map(o=>`<option ${r.op===o?'selected':''}>${o}</option>`).join('')}</select><input aria-label="条件值" type="${conditionFields[draft.template].find(f=>f[0]===r.field)?.[2]==='number'?'number':'text'}" min="0" value="${esc(r.value)}" oninput="setCondition(${gi},${ri},'value',this.value)"></div><div class="condition-row-foot"><button class="remove-condition" aria-label="删除条件" onclick="removeCondition(${gi},${ri})">×</button></div></div>`).join('')}</div></div><button class="dashed" onclick="draft.groups[${gi}].push(defaultCondition());renderEditor()">＋ 添加条件</button></div>`).join('')}<button class="dashed add-group" onclick="draft.groups.push([defaultCondition()]);renderEditor()">▱ 添加条件组</button></div><p class="hint">组内条件同时满足（且），条件组之间满足任一组（或）。</p>`}
function setCondition(g,r,k,v){const row=draft.groups[g][r];row[k]=v;if(k==='field'){const f=conditionFields[draft.template].find(x=>x[0]===v);row.op='等于';row.value=f[2]==='number'?'1':'';row.unit='';renderEditor()}else updatePreview()}
function removeConditionGroup(g){draft.groups.splice(g,1);renderEditor();toast("条件组已删除，保存后生效")}
function removeCondition(g,r){draft.groups[g].splice(r,1);if(!draft.groups[g].length)draft.groups.splice(g,1);renderEditor()}
function conditionSummary(){return draft.groups.map(g=>'（'+g.map(r=>(conditionFields[draft.template].find(f=>f[0]===r.field)?.[1]||r.field)+r.op+r.value).join(' 且 ')+'）').join(' 或 ')||'尚未配置条件'}
function scheduleText(){return (draft.schedule==='weekly'?'每周 '+draft.weekdays.join('、'):'每天')+' '+(draft.time||'未设置时间')}
const personDirectory=[{id:'10028',name:'林晓',role:'HR'},{id:'10036',name:'王婷',role:'HRBP'},{id:'10052',name:'周然',role:'人事主管'},{id:'10108',name:'刘海',role:'组长'},{id:'10126',name:'赵磊',role:'仓长'}];
function peoplePicker(){return `<div class="people-picker"><div class="people-search"><input id="personSearch" aria-label="搜索人员" placeholder="请通过工号/姓名搜索" oninput="searchPeople(this.value)" onfocus="searchPeople(this.value)"><button aria-label="搜索人员" onclick="searchPeople($('#personSearch').value)">⌕ 搜索</button></div><div id="peopleResults"></div><div class="people-chips">${draft.people.map(p=>`<button onclick="removePerson('${esc(p)}')">${esc(p)} ×</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`}
function searchPeople(q){const matches=personDirectory.filter(p=>(p.id+p.name).includes(q.trim()));$('#peopleResults').innerHTML=`<div class="people-results">${matches.map(p=>{const label=p.name+' · '+p.role;return `<button onclick="addPerson('${label}')" ${draft.people.includes(label)?'disabled':''}><b>${p.name}</b><span>${p.id} · ${p.role}</span>${draft.people.includes(label)?'已选择':'＋'}</button>`}).join('')||'<p class="hint">未找到匹配的人员</p>'}<button onclick="$('#peopleResults').innerHTML=''">× 收起</button></div>`}
function addPerson(p){if(!draft.people.includes(p))draft.people.push(p);renderEditor()}
function removePerson(p){draft.people=draft.people.filter(x=>x!==p);renderEditor()}
function toggleWeek(d,on){draft.weekdays=on?[...draft.weekdays,d]:draft.weekdays.filter(x=>x!==d);const order=['周一','周二','周三','周四','周五','周六','周日'];draft.weekdays.sort((a,b)=>order.indexOf(a)-order.indexOf(b));updatePreview()}
